WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
A checklist.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:07.210
Line one: "If you can keep your head
when all about you" Then more tests:

3
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.300
"If you can dream", and more, and more.

4
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.940
The list keeps growing.

5
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.610
Thirteen ifs, and not one box is ticked.

6
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.230
At the bottom sits a locked box.

7
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:23.030
Is this a father's advice, or
a test no one could ever pass?

8
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.770
In this mission, you'll see how Rudyard
Kipling builds the whole poem as one sentence,

9
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.870
waiting for its main clause.

10
00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:33.530
You'll meet two impostors,
called Triumph and Disaster.

11
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:37.810
And at last, you'll unlock the reward
waiting in the final two lines.

12
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.500
Your mission: decide whether it's advice,

13
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.620
or a test no one could pass.
